            code: `import torch

def apply_rotary_pos_emb(x, cos, sin):
    # x: [batch, seq_len, n_heads, head_dim]
    # Rotate half trick: [-x2, x1]
    def rotate_half(x):
        x1 = x[..., :x.shape[-1] // 2]
        x2 = x[..., x.shape[-1] // 2:]
        return torch.cat((-x2, x1), dim=-1)

    return (x * cos) + (rotate_half(x) * sin)`
